<title>USA: Indiana Energy Inc Q4 March 31 net falls.</title>
<headline>Indiana Energy Inc Q4 March 31 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>						   1997		  1996</p>
<p> Utility Operating Revenues	  $ 215,695	  $ 222,553</p>
<p> Net Income				   24,349	     26,234</p>
<p> Earnings Per Average Common Share	1.07		 1.16</p>
<p> Average Common Shares Outstanding    22,580	     22,535</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the three-month period ended March 31 is not indicative of net income for an annual period because to the seasonal sales of gas for space heating purposes.</p>
<p>					   Twelve Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>						   1997		  1996</p>
<p> Utility Operating Revenues	  $ 541,908	  $ 517,142</p>
<p> Net Income				   38,508	     45,333</p>
<p> Earnings Per Average Common Share	1.71		 2.01</p>
<p> Average Common Shares Outstanding    22,534	     22,549</p>
<p>(All Data In Thousands Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
